## Basic Data Types

| Data Type | Example | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `int` | `25` | Whole numbers |
| `float` | `25.5` | Decimal numbers |
| `str` | `"Python"` | Text |
| `bool` | `True` | True or False |
| `NoneType` | `None` | Absence of a value |

